Z||000003||FieroGT 914||09-15-2001||03:17 PM||||Hey skitime and LZeitgeist, thanks!!! It was an excellent b-day...  and you're both right - what more could a guy ask for than Jennifer?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>  Well, here's what happened... I come home from classes and get off the bus to walk back to my apt.  As I'm walkin thru the parking lot, I pass my car and notice there's a bunch of flowers on my trunk.  Well, I thought she put one of my roommates up to it since she said she couldn't get here until 6ish and it wasn't even 4pm.  So I walked into my room and there's more flowers on my bed and a card.  I went to my roommates room to find out what the deal was and she jumped out from behind the door to surprise me :-)  I had also noticed my closet door was closed when I was in my room and she told me to open it because one of my presents was in there...  So, I opened the door to find what else but a wing for my 87 GT!!!!!!  Whatta gal - like I said before, who could ask for more? She's so terrific! (guess she had to do something special since I went out of my way to Carlisle to get those custom Fiero keys for her b-day  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> - love ya Jen! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">)  She also made me a cd with songs that make her think of me and she baked me a cake too!  I'm definitely one incredibly lucky guy!<P>------------------<BR>Joe<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.worldlynx.net/asittingduck/FieroGT/Signature.jpg">    <BR>AOL I.M.: FieroGT 914<BR>White 86 1/2 GT (Stock)<BR>Maroon 87 GT (Mod)||||reg||7
